1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,255
May I have your attention please?

2
00:00:02,925 --> 00:00:10,890
This announcement is for all passengers waiting for Flight 705, scheduled to depart for London at 2 o'clock.

3
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:27,025
We have just been informed by Heathrow Airport that airplanes are being suspended for traveling to and from the airport due to heavy fog passing through the region and planes that are scheduled for arrival are being re-routed to other nearby airports.

4
00:00:28,075 --> 00:00:33,605
This, unfortunately, will also delay our flights scheduled to take off for London until further notice.

5
00:00:35,185 --> 00:00:43,015
In the meantime, the passengers that are affected are asked to take advantage of the refreshments we have set up in the lounge on the second floor.

6
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:46,965
Please show your ticket to the lounge attendant as you enter.

7
00:00:47,845 --> 00:00:55,325
For further announcements regarding the Heathrow situation, please check with the bulletin board display set up throughout the terminal.

8
00:00:56,065 --> 00:00:57,605
Thank you for your kind understanding.
